  "description": "A feature-rich WinUI 3 hex-viewer control for Windows App SDK.\n      GPU-accelerated via Win2D CanvasControl. Supports large-file streaming\n      via MemoryMappedFile (any size), mouse and keyboard selection, context-menu\n      copy (hex/ASCII), text and byte-sequence search (FindAllAsync), programmatic\n      selection (SelectRange / SelectFromTo), configurable offset formats\n      (hex/dec/oct), column grouping, full-width auto-fit, customisable colours,\n      ASCII encoding selection (IBM437, UTF-8, CP1252, …), hover cross-highlight,\n      SelectionChanged events, and scroll support for files larger than 2 GB.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
